      <h1 id="reviewing-an-agents-changes" class="group scroll-mt-20">Reviewing an agent's changes<a href="#reviewing-an-agents-changes" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1" data-pagefind-ignore>&para;</a></h1>
      <p>When an agent edits a DITA file, it does not overwrite your content. The editor records the edit as a tracked change, attributes it to the agent that proposed it, and waits for your decision.</p>
      <p>Your own edits are never marked this way.</p>
      <h2 id="reviewing-in-the-proposals-panel" class="group scroll-mt-20">Reviewing in the Proposals panel<a href="#reviewing-in-the-proposals-panel" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1" data-pagefind-ignore>&para;</a></h2>
      <Steps>
