      <strong>Open the Proposals panel</strong> Open <strong>Proposals</strong> in the right sidebar. Each entry shows the kind of change is and who proposed it.
      </Step>
      <Step>
      <strong>Select a proposal</strong> The editor moves to the affected part of the document and highlights the change in place so that you can review it in context.
      </Step>
      <Step>
      <strong>Decide</strong> Select <strong>Accept</strong> to keep the change or <strong>Reject</strong> to discard it. Use <strong>Accept all</strong> or <strong>Reject all</strong> to act on the whole set.
      </Step>
      </Steps>
      <h2 id="kinds-of-proposal" class="group scroll-mt-20">Kinds of proposal<a href="#kinds-of-proposal" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1" data-pagefind-ignore>&para;</a></h2>
      <Table class="my-4">
